      <key>PayloadDisplayName</key><string>NOVA OISD Big - Public RDNS</string>
      <key>PayloadDescription</key><string>Encrypt DNS on Wi-Fi and cellular. DNS queries are processed remotely by Public RDNS Lite, which advertises OISD Big filtering. No local filtering or remote VPN.</string>
